     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">Upcoming workshops: Short Read Trimming &amp; Quality Evaluation and De Novo RNAseq Assembly</div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">1. Short Read Trimming &amp; Quality Evaluation - March 28, 2016</span><br style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">Instructor: Titus Brown</span><br style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">Location: DSI Space, UC Davis Campus (</span><a href=\"http://dib-training.readthedocs.org/en/pub/DSI-space-directions.html\" style=\"font-size:12.8px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://dib-training.readthedocs.org/en/pub/DSI-space-directions.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467427324000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0yzum1WBjVuWDfxROTgK1k\">http://dib-training.readthedocs.org/en/pub/DSI-space-directions.html</a><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">)</span><br style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">Description: This workshop will cover trimming and quality evaluation of short read RNAseq data. We will use a stock data set and do analysis on the Amazon cloud.</span><br style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">This workshop will be broadcast via YouTube for those who wish to participate remotely.</span><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br><div><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">For more information: </span><a href=\"http://dib-training.readthedocs.org/en/pub/2016-02-17-regular-expressions-python.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://dib-training.readthedocs.org/en/pub/2016-02-17-regular-expressions-python.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467427324000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2BejdhHzjf119wC13j9ycO\"><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">http://dib-</span><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">training.readthedocs.org/en/</span><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">pub/2016-03-28-short-read-trim-qual-br.html</span></a></div><div><br></div><div>Register here (only if planning to come to the classroom): <a href=\"https://www.eventbrite.com/e/de-novo-mrnaseq-assembly-tickets-23826325180\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.eventbrite.com/e/de-novo-mrnaseq-assembly-tickets-23826325180&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467427324000&amp;usg=AOvVaw28nYuG0QSD5mq0oFusbEs6\">https://www.eventbrite.com/e/de-novo-mrnaseq-assembly-tickets-23826325180</a></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">2. De Novo RNAseq Assembly - March 30, 2016</div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">Instructor: Titus Brown</div><div><span style=\"font-size:small\">Location: DSI Space, UC Davis Campus (<a href=\"http://dib-trainin/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://dib-trainin/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467427324000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1vZjLPcvhbTLNFGEHqxUr_\">http://dib-trainin</a></span><a href=\"http://g.readthedocs.org/en/pub/DSI-space-directions.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://g.readthedocs.org/en/pub/DSI-space-directions.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467427324000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2CE5clq9wI0QQbEswo9ap-\">g.readthedocs.org/en/pub/DSI-space-directions.html</a>)<br><br>Description: This workshop will cover the assembly of de novo RNAseq data. We will use a stock data set and do analysis on the Amazon cloud.</div><br style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">For more information: </span><a href=\"http://dib-training.readthedocs.org/en/pub/2016-02-19-scipy-lr.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://dib-training.readthedocs.org/en/pub/2016-02-19-scipy-lr.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467427324000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2sZAYfxAFnfdux35WoeKQW\"><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">http://dib-training.</span><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">readthedocs.org/en/pub/2016-03-30-de-novo-mrnaseq-assem.html</span></a><br style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">Register here: <a href=\"https://www.eventbrite.com/e/de-novo-mrnaseq-assembly-tickets-23826325180\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.eventbrite.com/e/de-novo-mrnaseq-assembly-tickets-23826325180&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792467427324000&amp;usg=AOvVaw28nYuG0QSD5mq0oFusbEs6\">https://www.eventbrite.com/e/de-novo-mrnaseq-assembly-tickets-23826325180</a></span></div></div>\r\n"
